    synonyms (hide conceal)
  entry
    definition "be or go into hiding; keep out of sight, as for protection and safety"
    examples ("Probably his horse would be close to where he was hiding" "She is hiding out in a cabin in Montana")
    id oewn-02150244-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (hide "hide out")
  entry
    definition "cover as if with a shroud"
